{"name":"阴影","description":"模拟光影投射效果以构建界面元素悬浮感与视觉层级深度的样式属性。 · 弹窗、浮动菜单和需要与背景分开的卡片可以用 box-shadow；前两个值控制 x / y 偏移，后面可设置模糊、扩散和颜色。阴影只能辅助表达层级，浅色界面应保持轻微且方向一致；给每张卡片都加重阴影会让页面显得杂乱。","quote":"给卡片下面加一层淡淡的投影，让它像浮在页面上。","agentPrompt":"请建立统一阴影层级：普通卡片尽量平，Dropdown 和 Popover 使用轻阴影，Modal 使用更明确但克制的阴影，方向保持一致。不要给正文加阴影；在浅色和深色背景上分别检查边界。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-shadow\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>阴影<span>Shadow</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">给卡片下面加一层淡淡的投影，让它像浮在页面上。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">模拟光影投射效果以构建界面元素悬浮感与视觉层级深度的样式属性。</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>弹窗、浮动菜单和需要与背景分开的卡片可以用 box-shadow；前两个值控制 x / y 偏移，后面可设置模糊、扩散和颜色。阴影只能辅助表达层级，浅色界面应保持轻微且方向一致；给每张卡片都加重阴影会让页面显得杂乱。</span></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>阴影</em><em>盒阴影</em><em>投影</em><em>box-shadow</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"shadow-demo\"><span class=\"shadow-card shadow-s1\">浅</span><span class=\"shadow-card shadow-s2\">中</span><span class=\"shadow-card shadow-s3\">浮起</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请建立统一阴影层级：普通卡片尽量平，Dropdown 和 Popover 使用轻阴影，Modal 使用更明确但克制的阴影，方向保持一致。不要给正文加阴影；在浅色和深色背景上分别检查边界。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"card\" aria-label=\"卡片 Card\">卡片 <b>Card</b></a> <b>悬停浮起</b>：浅阴影提示可点</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:40px;height:26px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:5px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">→</span><span style=\"width:40px;height:26px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(29,33,41,.14)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/modal?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"modal\" aria-label=\"弹窗 Modal\">弹窗 <b>Modal</b></a>、<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/drawer?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"drawer\" aria-label=\"抽屉 Drawer\">抽屉 <b>Drawer</b></a> <b>压在最上层</b>：阴影更明显</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div><span style=\"position:absolute;top:14px;right:12px;width:56px;height:34px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(29,33,41,.22)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a> 下拉、<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/tooltip?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"tooltip\" aria-label=\"文字提示 Tooltip\">文字提示 <b>Tooltip</b></a> <b>浮层边缘</b>：和页面区分开</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-select\">全部状态<i class=\"mk-caret\"></i></span><div class=\"mk-drop\"><span class=\"mk-opt \">全部状态</span><span class=\"mk-opt on\">进行中</span><span class=\"mk-opt \">已完成</span><span class=\"mk-opt \">已过期</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>内阴影</b>做凹陷：输入框、进度槽往里凹</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:70px;height:14px;border-radius:99px;background:#ebedf0;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 3px rgba(29,33,41,.18)\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">内阴影可以表现向内凹陷的表面</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">阴影<b>过深过重</b>：会让元素层级显得突兀</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span style=\"width:52px;height:30px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:5px;box-shadow:0 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.55)\"></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>每个元素都加阴影</b>：会削弱层级区分</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.3)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.3)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.3)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.3)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">阴影方向<b>不一致</b>：应在全站统一光源方向</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(29,33,41,.25)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;box-shadow:0 -4px 6px rgba(29,33,41,.25)\"></span><span style=\"width:24px;height:16px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:3px;box-shadow:5px 0 6px rgba(29,33,41,.25)\"></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">给<b>正文文字加投影</b>会降低字形清晰度，不能替代对比度</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);text-shadow:2px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.5)\">正文加了投影</span></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"shadow-anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"element\"><span class=\"shadow-anat-el\">卡片</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"shadow\"><span class=\"shadow-anat-sh\"></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"light\"><span class=\"shadow-anat-light\">☀</span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"element\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">元素本体</span><span class=\"pe\">Element</span></button><span class=\"pd\">投下阴影的那个盒子</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"shadow\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">阴影</span><span class=\"pe\">Shadow</span></button><span class=\"pd\">x / y 偏移 + 模糊 + 扩散，颜色带透明度</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"light\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">光源</span><span class=\"pe\">Light</span></button><span class=\"pd\">全站统一一个方向，阴影才不乱</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">浅阴影<span>Small</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"shadow-card shadow-s1\">卡片</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">普通卡片的默认层次</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">中阴影<span>Medium</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"shadow-card shadow-s2\">浮起</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">悬停浮起、下拉菜单</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">浮起阴影<span>Large</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"shadow-card shadow-s3\">弹窗</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">弹窗、抽屉这类最上层</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">内阴影<span>Inset</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"shadow-card shadow-inset\">凹槽</span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">输入框、进度槽做凹陷感</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">卡片悬停浮起</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;justify-content:center;padding-top:6px\">\n      <div style=\"width:132px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:12px\">设计规范.md</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:4px\">昨天 18:02 更新</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:8px\">默认 · 几乎无阴影</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"width:132px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.13);transform:translateY(-4px)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:12px\">首页改版.fig</b>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:4px\">2 小时前更新</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--brand);margin-top:8px\">悬停 · 阴影加深浮起</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">弹窗与抽屉</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:150px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n      <div style=\"padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:55%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:82%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:40%\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:250px;max-width:calc(100% - 40px);background:var(--bg);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.24)\">\n        <span class=\"shadow-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:-10px;right:12px\">大阴影 = 最上层</span>\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px\">发布新版本？</b>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;margin-top:12px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px\">取消</button><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"padding:5px 12px;font-size:12px\">发布</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">下拉浮层</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:250px;margin:0 auto;padding-top:6px\">\n      <div class=\"demo-select-wrap\"><span class=\"demo-select\" style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;padding:7px 30px 7px 12px\">按最近更新排序</span></div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;margin-top:6px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.15);overflow:hidden\">\n        <span class=\"shadow-sc-chip\" style=\"position:absolute;top:6px;right:6px\">浮层阴影</span>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">最近更新</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand)\">最多收藏 ✓</div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">最新发布</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">凹陷的进度槽</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;padding-top:6px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:7px\"><span>存储空间</span><span>7.2 / 10 GB</span></div>\n      <div style=\"height:10px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--bg-hover);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.18);position:relative\">\n        <span style=\"position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:72%;border-radius:99px;background:var(--brand)\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"shadow-sc-note\">槽用 <b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">inset 内阴影</b>凹进去，填充条才像嵌在里面</div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/box-shadow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">box-shadow 属性</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/shadow","markdown":"# 阴影Shadow\n\n你可能会说\n给卡片下面加一层淡淡的投影，让它像浮在页面上。\n\n**模拟光影投射效果以构建界面元素悬浮感与视觉层级深度的样式属性。**·弹窗、浮动菜单和需要与背景分开的卡片可以用 box-shadow；前两个值控制 x / y 偏移，后面可设置模糊、扩散和颜色。阴影只能辅助表达层级，浅色界面应保持轻微且方向一致；给每张卡片都加重阴影会让页面显得杂乱。\n\n也常被叫作阴影盒阴影投影box-shadow\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请建立统一阴影层级：普通卡片尽量平，Dropdown 和 Popover 使用轻阴影，Modal 使用更明确但克制的阴影，方向保持一致。不要给正文加阴影；在浅色和深色背景上分别检查边界。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- [卡片 **Card**](/vibe-hub/card?lang=zh) **悬停浮起**：浅阴影提示可点\n\n→\n- [弹窗 **Modal**](/vibe-hub/modal?lang=zh)、[抽屉 **Drawer**](/vibe-hub/drawer?lang=zh) **压在最上层**：阴影更明显\n- [选择器 **Select**](/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh) 下拉、[文字提示 **Tooltip**](/vibe-hub/tooltip?lang=zh) **浮层边缘**：和页面区分开\n\n全部状态\n全部状态进行中已完成已过期\n- **内阴影**做凹陷：输入框、进度槽往里凹\n\n内阴影可以表现向内凹陷的表面\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 阴影**过深过重**：会让元素层级显得突兀\n- **每个元素都加阴影**：会削弱层级区分\n- 阴影方向**不一致**：应在全站统一光源方向\n- 给**正文文字加投影**会降低字形清晰度，不能替代对比度\n\n正文加了投影\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n卡片☀\n\n1元素本体Element投下阴影的那个盒子\n\n2阴影Shadowx / y 偏移 + 模糊 + 扩散，颜色带透明度\n\n3光源Light全站统一一个方向，阴影才不乱\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n浅阴影Small\n\n卡片\n\n普通卡片的默认层次\n\n中阴影Medium\n\n浮起\n\n悬停浮起、下拉菜单\n\n浮起阴影Large\n\n弹窗\n\n弹窗、抽屉这类最上层\n\n内阴影Inset\n\n凹槽\n\n输入框、进度槽做凹陷感\n\n典型使用场景\n\n卡片悬停浮起\n\n**设计规范.md**\n        \n昨天 18:02 更新\n\n        \n默认 · 几乎无阴影\n\n      \n**首页改版.fig**\n        \n2 小时前更新\n\n        \n悬停 · 阴影加深浮起\n\n弹窗与抽屉\n\n大阴影 = 最上层\n        **发布新版本？**\n        \n取消发布\n\n下拉浮层\n\n按最近更新排序\n\n      \n浮层阴影\n        \n最近更新\n\n        \n最多收藏 ✓\n\n        \n最新发布\n\n凹陷的进度槽\n\n存储空间7.2 / 10 GB\n\n      \n\n      \n槽用 **inset 内阴影**凹进去，填充条才像嵌在里面\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[box-shadow 属性MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/box-shadow)"}